{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39502","headline":"丛苇 · 张蠙","name":"丛苇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丛丛寒水边，曾折打鱼船。\n忽与亭台近，翻嫌岛屿偏。\n花明无月夜，声急正秋天。\n遥忆巴陵渡，残阳一望烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}